@page "/projects/graphics-fundamentals"
@using website.Data

<div class="bg-gray-900 min-h-screen text-white p-8">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
            <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
                2D Graphics Fundamentals
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                Computer Graphics Coursework 1 - Implementing fundamental 2D graphics algorithms including line drawing, triangle rasterization, and image processing with comprehensive performance analysis and testing frameworks.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Project Overview -->
        <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-8 mb-8 border border-gray-700">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-cyan-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-palette text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Project Overview</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">COMP3811 Computer Graphics Coursework 1</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                This comprehensive computer graphics coursework focused on implementing fundamental 2D graphics operations including
                pixel manipulation, line drawing algorithms, triangle rasterization, and image blitting. The project required
                building graphics primitives from scratch in C++, implementing mathematical algorithms for geometric rendering,
                and developing comprehensive testing and benchmarking frameworks.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                The coursework emphasized low-level graphics programming, algorithmic efficiency, and mathematical precision,
                providing deep understanding of the foundational concepts underlying modern graphics systems and game engines.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Implementation -->
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
            <!-- Core Graphics Algorithms -->
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-blue-600 rounded-full p-2 mr-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-vector-square text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Core Graphics Algorithms</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li>• <strong>Line Drawing:</strong> Bresenham's algorithm and DDA implementation</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Triangle Rasterization:</strong> Barycentric coordinate interpolation</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Pixel Manipulation:</strong> Surface class with RGBA handling</li>
                    <li>• <strong>2D Transformations:</strong> Rotation matrices and coordinate systems</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Image Blitting:</strong> Alpha-masked image composition</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Clipping Algorithms:</strong> Viewport boundary handling</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Performance & Testing -->
            <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-6 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300">
                <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
                    <div class="bg-green-600 rounded-full p-2 mr-3">
                        <i class="fas fa-chart-line text-white"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Performance & Testing</h3>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                    <li>• <strong>Benchmarking:</strong> Google Benchmark integration for timing analysis</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Testing Framework:</strong> Catch2 automated testing with custom scenarios</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Algorithm Comparison:</strong> DDA vs Bresenham performance analysis</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Memory Optimization:</strong> Zero dynamic allocation constraints</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Visual Validation:</strong> Sandbox applications for algorithm testing</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Edge Case Handling:</strong> Comprehensive clipping and boundary tests</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Deep Dive -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-purple-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-code text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Implementation Highlights</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Advanced graphics programming techniques and optimizations</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-2">Line Drawing Algorithms</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Implemented both Bresenham's and DDA algorithms with comprehensive performance
                        comparison. Ensured pixel-perfect rendering with proper clipping and no gaps
                        between connected line segments.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-400 mb-2">Triangle Rasterization</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Built triangle rendering with barycentric coordinate interpolation for smooth
                        color gradients. Handled edge cases and optimized for different triangle
                        orientations and sizes.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-800 rounded-lg p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-2">Performance Optimization</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
                        Achieved O(N) complexity for all algorithms, avoided dynamic allocations,
                        and implemented comprehensive benchmarking to validate performance
                        characteristics across different input sizes.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Features -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-orange-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-star text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Key Technical Features</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Advanced implementations and algorithmic optimizations</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-3">Graphics Primitives</h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                        <li>✓ Pixel-level surface manipulation with RGBx format</li>
                        <li>✓ Anti-aliased line rendering with sub-pixel accuracy</li>
                        <li>✓ Triangle rasterization with color interpolation</li>
                        <li>✓ Alpha-masked image blitting with transparency</li>
                        <li>✓ 2D matrix transformations and coordinate systems</li>
                        <li>✓ Viewport clipping and boundary handling</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-green-400 mb-3">Testing & Validation</h3>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-2">
                        <li>✓ Comprehensive test suites with edge case coverage</li>
                        <li>✓ Visual validation tools and sandbox applications</li>
                        <li>✓ Performance benchmarking with statistical analysis</li>
                        <li>✓ Algorithm comparison and optimization metrics</li>
                        <li>✓ Cross-platform compatibility testing</li>
                        <li>✓ Memory leak detection and resource management</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Specifications -->
        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-lg p-8 border border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/50 transition-all duration-300 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center mb-6">
                <div class="bg-red-600 rounded-full p-3 mr-4">
                    <i class="fas fa-cogs text-white text-xl"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Technical Specifications</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-400">Implementation details and development environment</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-cyan-400 mb-3">Development Stack</h4>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• C++ (Modern C++17 standards)</li>
                        <li>• Premake5 build system</li>
                        <li>• GLFW for window management</li>
                        <li>• OpenGL for display output</li>
                        <li>• Visual Studio/GCC compilation</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-green-400 mb-3">Testing Framework</h4>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• Catch2 testing library</li>
                        <li>• Google Benchmark for performance</li>
                        <li>• Custom validation scenarios</li>
                        <li>• Automated regression testing</li>
                        <li>• Visual debugging tools</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-3">Performance Targets</h4>
                    <ul class="text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li>• O(N) algorithmic complexity</li>
                        <li>• Zero dynamic allocations</li>
                        <li>• Real-time rendering capability</li>
                        <li>• Cross-platform compatibility</li>
                        <li>• Memory-efficient implementations</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
